difficulty or perhaps even arbitrariness of deciding which to 

use with a given selbri.

>>

Well, I am pretty surte that there are cases outside of selbri (and what about {jetnu} and {jitfa} within brivla as selbri) where the distinction needs to be maintained.  Semantics if nowhere else.
